  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4104.48 Specialty adhesive remover",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4104.48 “Specialty adhesive remover” means a product designed to remove reactive adhesives from a variety of substrates. The term does not include gasket or thread locking adhesive remover.\n\nSource. #10527, eff 2-26-14; ss by #13969, eff 5-21-24 (formerly Env-A 4104.49)",
